1. Scope

This license applies only to the eggplant images and bounding box
annotations released as the Eggplant Field Detection Dataset. It does not
license or grant access to model source code, model weights, or the
associated manuscript.

2. Permitted use

Individuals may download, copy, analyze, and modify the dataset for their
own personal, non-commercial learning, research, and evaluation, subject
to the attribution requirements below. Reporting non-commercial research
results based on such permitted use is allowed with attribution.

This license does not automatically authorize use on behalf of an
organization or institution. Any use outside the permitted scope,
including commercial use, requires prior written permission from the
dataset rights holder. Permission requests may be sent to the contact
address below.

3. Attribution and modifications

When using the dataset or reporting results based on it, acknowledge the Eggplant Field Detection Dataset and identify its Zenodo DOI or original record URL and the release version used. Retain any supplied creator credits,
copyright notices, and this license notice. Clearly identify any changes
to the images, annotations, or dataset partition. Do not imply endorsement
by the dataset creators.

